# These are wasm-pack build outputs, not hand-edited sources.
#
# The .wasm module must never be line-ending converted. Git's binary heuristic
# would almost certainly catch it, but a silently CRLF-mangled .wasm fails at
# instantiation with an opaque error, so pin it explicitly rather than rely on
# detection.
*.wasm binary

# Keep the generated JS/TS glue at LF so the checked-in bytes match wasm-pack
# output exactly and re-running the build produces an empty diff on Windows.
*.js text eol=lf
*.d.ts text eol=lf
